{"version":1,"content":"<html>\n<body><p>更新時間：17:48 2026-11-15 HKT<br/>發佈時間：17:48 2026-11-15 HKT</p>\n<p>發佈時間：17:48 2026-11-15 HKT</p><img src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/3b0957dc42c8b1fc7a73b59c24609f3e/2026-11/001_8.png\"/><p>牛頭角發生盜竊案。今日（15日）早上11時許，警方接獲一名41歲姓賴女子報案，指其牛頭角下邨貴輝樓寓所內，有一批約值50萬元的金器及31萬元現金不翼而飛。據了解，31萬元現金中有8萬為外幣，包括圓、韓圜及人民幣，其餘為港元。</p><p>警方經初步調查，案件列盜竊，交由秀茂坪警區刑事調查隊第五隊跟進，暫未有人被捕。</p><p></p><p>最Hit</p>\n</body>\n</html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-15T09:58:47.196216+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":235,"images":1,"source":"星島頭條","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-15T09:48:08+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-15T20:20:57.344154+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-15T09:52:42.887514+00:00","content_hash":"4215811c9f977cf78a35fd766b774ee54adeb04a02848fa7c7079185ce8abc11","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}